## Motion

- Prefer `transform` and `opacity`
- Avoid bounce / elastic easing unless brand-defining

## Product UI craft

When a screen names an object and asks for a commit:

- Overlay controls own their contrast on any media
- Shared layout inset; chrome quieter than content
- Title + trust + cost/status in one first-read cluster
- Pair quantity/filters with the commit control; put the consequence on the button
- Long pages: sticky identity and sticky primary action
- Check mobile, desktop, and web if those surfaces ship

Full playbook: skill `frontend-design` → `reference.md` when installed.

